      "content": "hey can u help me with some research? i'm looking at how much influence international organizations like the WTO or the UN actually have on how countries run their own economies nowadays. like, is the trend towards more global trade agreements generally considered a positive step for stability, or is it mostly seen as a way for countries to lose their independence? turn it into a brief summary of the pros and cons if u can. weight",
